1
00:00:18,839 --> 00:00:19,760
Hello.

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:20,719
I'm really sorry.

3
00:00:20,719 --> 00:00:21,960
The restaurant was late preparing the food.

4
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:24,079
I might be a few minutes late.

5
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:27,440
Can I confirm the delivery in advance?

6
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,719
Otherwise, I'll be fined.

7
00:00:30,079 --> 00:00:30,800
No, no, no. Yes, yes.

8
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,520
I'm delivering your order first right now.

9
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:33,600
Hello?

10
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,079
Please don't be mad.

11
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:35,000
I'll be right there, okay?

12
00:00:35,719 --> 00:00:37,039
I'm only two kilometers away.

13
00:00:37,039 --> 00:00:37,399
No.

14
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,560
P-Please don't be mad.

15
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,359
I... I really...

16
00:00:39,359 --> 00:00:40,000
They were late making it.

17
00:00:40,039 --> 00:00:40,759
It's not my fault.

18
00:00:40,759 --> 00:00:42,000
I'll be right there, okay?

19
00:01:09,239 --> 00:01:09,920
Get up!

20
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,000
Get up! Fight back!

21
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:15,239
Get up!

22
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,040
No.

23
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,200
I won't fight back.

24
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,239
I came here today to take a beating.

25
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,519
Fine.

26
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,680
Then I won't hold back.

27
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:27,799
Still afraid to die, huh?

28
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,920
For all these years,

29
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,439
I've been repenting.

30
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,159
You...

31
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,519
You repenting?

32
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,920
What the hell good is your repenting?!

33
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:46,439
Where were you back then?!

34
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,519
I went to the hospital back then.

35
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,439
You just didn't know.

36
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,240
These are

37
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:15,840
the flowers I delivered to this bed.

38
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,120
Who sent them?

39
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,520
I... I don't know.

40
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,000
My colleague transferred the order to me.

41
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,080
Do I know you?

42
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,800
You've delivered food to our house before.

43
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,319
Yeah.

44
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,800
I deliver to that whole area.

45
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,039
If there's nothing else,

46
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:37,080
I'll get going.

47
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,159
Wait a minute.

48
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,159
What's this?

49
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,800
You're the rider who ran the red light.

50
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,960
This is all my savings.

51
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,080
I'm sorry.

52
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,560
Zhang Ya never told me.

53
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,759
She told me not to tell you.

54
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,240
She said you would never forgive me.

55
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,159
And she forgave you?

56
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:32,039
I... I don't know.

57
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,639
We only met that one time.

58
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,840
She told me never to go back.

59
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,840
No, no.

60
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,240
I don't get it.

61
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,560
Why did you go see her?

62
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,599
None of the security cameras caught you.

63
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:51,000
We didn't know what you looked like.

64
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,479
Don't lie.

65
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,240
Because you treated me so well.

66
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,639
What did you say?

67
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:07,199
I wear a sweater under my shirt to keep warm.

68
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,800
The thing is, it scratches my neck.

69
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,319
Just give me this one.

70
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,599
All the male celebrities dress like this now.

71
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,919
How come I've never seen any male celebrity dress like this?

72
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,439
That delivery is ours, right?

73
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,360
I think so.

74
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,120
Sir.

75
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,160
Unit 1, 502.

76
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:22,000
Right.

77
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,800
This is mine.

78
00:04:23,279 --> 00:04:23,680
No.

79
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,319
0223.

80
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:25,199
My last name is Xie.

81
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:25,639
Okay. No.

82
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,680
Let me carry it for you. It's pretty heavy.

83
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,199
It's fine.

84
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,120
Thanks a lot.

85
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,040
Thanks then.

86
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:30,240
No problem. Bye.

87
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:30,959
Bye.

88
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,160
Look at his leg.

89
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:45,639
Sir.

90
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,160
What is it?

91
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:48,879
Here.

92
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,560
Take this.

93
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:51,879
No, no, no.

94
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,639
I don't want it. No, no.

95
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,000
Just take it, take it. It's fine.

96
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,199
The roads are slippery in the rain.

97
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,000
Stay safe.

98
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,839
Alright, thanks.

99
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:57,560
Alright, goodbye.

100
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,240
Goodbye.

101
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,199
Take it slow, Sir.

102
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,040
Thanks.

103
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,439
Friendly reminder.

104
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,959
One minute left in this round.

105
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,839
Hit me now, or it'll be too late.

106
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,199
Only one minute left. Don't worry.

107
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,199
I definitely won't dodge this time.

108
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,480
Move, move, move!

109
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,240
Mr. Xie, only one minute left.

110
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,160
I forfeit! I forfeit!

111
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,040
You...

112
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,560
You're sparing me.

113
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,920
It's what my wife wanted.

114
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:52,519
The match is over.

115
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:56,600
There are no losers in this round either.

116
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,040
Thank you.

117
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:02,920
Don't thank me.

118
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,360
Thank whoever you should. Now go.

119
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:05,519
Okay.

120
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,439
Fun, fun, fun.

121
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,560
It's the final round.

122
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,800
Will you let me go after this?

123
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,199
Of course.

124
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,120
But there's an additional rule this round.

125
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,040
You can't forfeit.

126
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:02,120
The penalty for failing is also a bit harsher.

127
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:03,879
Which is...

128
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:06,040
electrocuting me, right?

129
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:29,319
Who are you?

130
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:30,639
I'm Xie Xin.

131
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,240
And who are you?

132
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,079
Wait, wait, wait.

133
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,959
This is a bit confusing.

134
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,040
Tell you what,

135
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,240
let's take it one at a time.

136
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:38,199
You first. How did you get here?

137
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,639
I don't know.

138
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:40,759
I was drinking at a bar,

139
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:42,560
then someone started chasing me.

140
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,639
Then I passed out,

141
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,879
and woke up here.

142
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,519
I don't know anything.

143
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,399
I didn't do anything.

144
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,360
Alright.

145
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,120
Then what?

146
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,639
Then I have to beat you.

147
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,160
If I beat you, I can get out.

148
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,240
That's too bad.

149
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,079
You can't beat me.

150
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,240
I will win.

151
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,639
I told you, you can't beat me.

152
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,120
Look at you.

153
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,240
Even though I don't know how you won,

154
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,879
you definitely had people looking out for you.

155
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:33,879
Here's the deal,

156
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,200
Xie Xin.

157
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,639
I won't hit you. I won't hit you.

158
00:08:39,279 --> 00:08:40,879
How about this, let me sum you up.

159
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,399
As for you...

160
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,440
If I say you're a good person,

161
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,799
you definitely aren't.

162
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,919
If I say you're a bad person,

163
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:52,840
you're not exactly bad either.

164
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,799
Of course, that's completely normal.

165
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,240
Because there are way too many people in this world

166
00:08:56,279 --> 00:08:58,399
who are stuck somewhere between good and bad.

167
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,879
You know what your problem is?

168
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,720
You just love giving yourself an out.

169
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:03,639
You...

170
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,639
You've spoiled yourself rotten.

171
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:08,960
You completely coddle yourself, you know?

172
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:11,200
Why do you have so many reasons?

173
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,600
So many excuses?

174
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,000
Like you're the only one wronged.

175
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,120
Like you're always right.

176
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,159
You chose this path.

177
00:09:18,559 --> 00:09:19,759
You said those words.

178
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:20,759
You did those things.

179
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,840
So just own up to it.

180
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,240
Right?

181
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,639
You probably don't understand anyway.

182
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,240
Tell you what,

183
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:35,120
while keeping our gloves

184
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,039
from touching each other,

185
00:09:37,879 --> 00:09:39,799
stick out your right elbow.

186
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,440
That's it. Hook onto me.

187
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,320
Hook onto me.

188
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,519
Okay, ready to get up.

189
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:46,320
One, two, go.

190
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,000
Good work.

191
00:10:07,159 --> 00:10:08,360
The match is over.

192
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:10,559
Both sides have equal points.

193
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,360
It's a joint victory.

194
00:12:04,799 --> 00:12:05,759
Heart rate?

195
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,240
Heart rate is 45.

196
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,159
Heart rate is too low.

197
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,639
Blood oxygen level?

198
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:15,320
70.

199
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,080
Administer oxygen.

200
00:12:16,399 --> 00:12:17,000
Okay.

201
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,159
Prepare an adrenaline shot.

202
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:18,919
Right away.

203
00:12:19,279 --> 00:12:20,240
Start chest compressions.

204
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,639
Prepare for defibrillation.

205
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:23,840
Hurry!

206
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,519
Okay.

207
00:12:35,639 --> 00:12:37,039
IV epinephrine, 0.5.

208
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:37,919
Okay.

209
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:08,159
Confirmed. It's Xie Xin.

210
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,639
They're working on him right now,

211
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:11,159
but it's not looking good.

212
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:12,279
The family's been notified.

213
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,919
They should be here by now.

214
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:26,720
I'll... I'll keep watch a bit longer, okay?

215
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,440
I'll head back... head back later.

216
00:13:34,279 --> 00:13:35,039
Zhang Ya.

217
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,360
I'm Shen Li.

218
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,000
Here.

219
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:42,240
This is his phone.

220
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,159
Thank you.

221
00:13:44,639 --> 00:13:46,879
So you're the one who brought Xie Xin to the hospital.

222
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:49,720
Yeah, I just happened to see him having a heart attack.

223
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,720
It wasn't just a coincidence, was it?

224
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,000
Right.

225
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,279
Well...

226
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:11,600
Because our squad received a tip,

227
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,360
saying he...

228
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,000
saying, um...

229
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:15,440
someone was selling fake drugs at the bar.

230
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:16,600
So I...

231
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:37,559
Xie Xin once told me...

232
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:41,720
...that people want to say four things on their deathbed.

233
00:14:43,519 --> 00:14:44,440
What four things?

234
00:14:47,759 --> 00:14:49,799
I really want to know who he would say them to.

235
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,120
I'm looking for Grandpa Lin.

236
00:14:57,559 --> 00:14:58,399
He doesn't work here anymore.

237
00:14:58,399 --> 00:14:59,639
He handed this shop over to me.

238
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,919
I'm sorry.

239
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,240
Xie Xin.

240
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:10,279
Thank you.

241
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,879
I forgive you.

242
00:15:22,919 --> 00:15:23,960
I love you.

243
00:15:34,879 --> 00:15:36,320
Um, family of the patient...

244
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,480
It's all just a dream,

245
00:16:31,559 --> 00:16:32,240
right?

246
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:36,960
Then I'll give you one last sweet dream.

247
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:03,240
Going all out

248
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:07,720
Equally matched
